{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02751",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 5.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "end_seconds": 11.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.19,
      "end_seconds": 18.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I've been dealing with severe thirst and passing lots of urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.24,
      "end_seconds": 23.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.2,
      "end_seconds": 38.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.38,
      "end_seconds": 68.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "Okay: height 169 centimetres, temperature 37.0, BMI works out to 34.0. And weight 97 kilos, blood pressure 95 over 63, pulse 99."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.68,
      "end_seconds": 73.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.8,
      "end_seconds": 80.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers. How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.96,
      "end_seconds": 93.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.12,
      "text": "I've had it for six months. I've also had being very confused, since last weekend. I had bone pain before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.8,
      "end_seconds": 102.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Have you had severe thirst and passing lots of urine before, or is this the the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.6,
      "end_seconds": 107.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "a bit, last year it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.28,
      "end_seconds": 112.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, chest pain or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.39,
      "end_seconds": 117.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.78,
      "end_seconds": 123.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.01,
      "end_seconds": 126.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.52,
      "end_seconds": 150.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "so, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.48,
      "end_seconds": 156.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had high cholesterol for about ten years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.56,
      "end_seconds": 165.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol is known to us, good to have that clear. Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.47,
      "end_seconds": 171.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.93,
      "end_seconds": 174.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.85,
      "end_seconds": 178.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.13,
      "end_seconds": 181.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.5,
      "end_seconds": 184.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.28,
      "end_seconds": 188.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.93,
      "end_seconds": 193.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.23,
      "end_seconds": 200.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.63,
      "end_seconds": 203.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.0,
      "end_seconds": 221.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "You are dehydrated and drowsy with a slow, odd rhythm on the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.16,
      "end_seconds": 227.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.38,
      "end_seconds": 256.01,
      "duration_seconds": 15.63,
      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, it points towards a high calcium emergency. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let's get urgent blood tests, for confusion and polyuria"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.04,
      "end_seconds": 260.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Mm, uh, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.28,
      "end_seconds": 296.54,
      "duration_seconds": 35.26,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour, single dose. It's for dehydration. You need hospital fluids and treatment now. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's plan a check straight away. Okay, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.97,
      "end_seconds": 301.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense thanks for explaining"
    }
  ]
}